  "details": "i whould like to use physics to create simple games, a simple use limited addforce action should be enough. Also i  think it would be usefull to have some triggers for distance, position and direction of transforms, here my sigestion:\n-A trigger for distance betweent transforms, it takes two transforms and a float for distance, you can choose if triggers when greater or less than distance.\n-[just give aware that this can be made by a onEnterTrigger event and a sphereCollider, still need the set position] A trigger to compare positions of transforms (triggers when equals) plus an action to set position (can take a transform). This should open the possibility for interesting contraptions.\n-A trigger to detect the direction of movement, it takes a Vector3 for direction and a float for tolerance angle. this can be made using the rigidbody, or by using a last-position-algorithm. This trigger works as accelerometer sensor.",
